1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,458
Then the yoga story.

2
00:00:01,458 --> 00:00:11,653
A yoga teacher in Israel explained, in all seriousness, that yoga was invented by Abraham, and that the postures come from the shapes of the Hebrew letters.

3
00:00:11,653 --> 00:00:18,098
Abraham taught them to the son of one of his concubines, who went to India and taught the Indians.

4
00:00:18,098 --> 00:00:19,244
The evidence?

5
00:00:19,244 --> 00:00:25,338
A Bible verse: Abraham gave the sons of his concubines gifts and sent them east.

6
00:00:25,338 --> 00:00:26,979
What do you think these gifts were?

7
00:00:26,979 --> 00:00:30,377
The joke is the leap from a gift in a verse to yoga.

